1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,079
Should you ask a chatbot when to vote?

2
00:00:06,929 --> 00:00:12,507
In a September study, 29% of chatbot answers
on voting were incomplete, wrong or outdated.

3
00:00:13,457 --> 00:00:18,936
One chatbot even got Election Day wrong.

4
00:00:19,886 --> 00:00:25,364
Election Day is Tuesday, November 3.

5
00:00:26,614 --> 00:00:33,014
One chatbot said November fourth. That's a
Wednesday.
